# Track only README files inside datasets (case-insensitive filename).
datasets/**
outputs/**
!datasets/**/
!datasets/**/[Rr][Ee][Aa][Dd][Mm][Ee].[Mm][Dd]

*.h5

# Ignore every Markdown file except README files (case-insensitive filename).
*.[Mm][Dd]
![Rr][Ee][Aa][Dd][Mm][Ee].[Mm][Dd]
!**/[Rr][Ee][Aa][Dd][Mm][Ee].[Mm][Dd]
![Aa][Gg][Ee][Nn][Tt][Ss].[Mm][Dd]
!docs/**/*.[Mm][Dd]
